# Fixtures are committed; the ones a test WRITES are not.
#
# tests/test_langpop_import.p builds freq-ja-tmp.txt in here, scans it,
# and deletes it again, because a Japanese frequency sample has to carry
# real punctuation and real kana and is easier to write than to read in a
# diff.  It was committed once by accident, which meant every test run
# deleted a tracked file and left the tree dirty.
#
# A fixture the suite can regenerate does not belong to the repository.
*-tmp.txt
